  "description": "The 3-point quick tractor hitch is mainly suitable for Category 1 tractors. This allows you to easily connect your tractor to your 3 pt tractor within minutes saving you time and labor.\nFitment\nCompatible with CAT 1 3-Pt Tractor\nFeatures\nFITS CATEGORY 1 TRACTORS: Designed for Category 1 three-point systems, this quick hitch lets you connect plows, mowers, and other attachments in minutes - no more struggling to line things up. Save time, cut down on manual labor, and get back to work faster.\n5-POSITION ADJUSTABLE HOOK: With 7 holes for 5 quick-height settings, it bolts directly onto your tractor's 3 point quick hitch. No welding, modification, or extra parts needed - get the right height in seconds and get back to work. Built tough to save you time and effort on the farm.\nVERSATILE QUICK HITCH ADAPTER: Connect your Category 1 quick hitch to a wider range of attachments - like snowplows, mowers, and so on. It works with medium to large equipment that doesn't meet ASABE quick hitch standards, so you can use more tools without changing your setup.\n3000LBS LIFTING & TOWING CAPACITY: The heavy-duty reinforced 3 point hitch attachment is structurally stable and has 3000 lbs lifting capacity. The steel plates on both sides of the top hook are reinforced to a thickness of 0.16\", The pin hooks have a limit function on both sides for increased stability and safety.\nWIDE COMPATIBILITY: This 3-point quick hitch fits most Category 1 tractors and includes a 2-inch receiver for attaching a trailer ball or other attachments. Handle everything from field work to hauling - meets a variety of farming and towing needs with one tough, time-saving connection.",
